{
 "id": "story-golden-axe",
 "type": "story",
 "source": "Korean folk tale, retold in simple Korean for this site.",
 "items": [
  {
   "text": "옛날에 착한 나무꾼이 살았어요.",
   "roman": "yennare chakan namukkuni sarasseoyo.",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "Long ago, there lived a kind woodcutter."
   },
   "image": "🏡🧑‍🌾"
  },
  {
   "text": "어느 날, 나무꾼은 연못 옆에서 나무를 했어요.",
   "roman": "eoneu nal, namukkuneun yeonmot yeopeseo namureul haesseoyo.",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "One day, the woodcutter was chopping wood beside a pond."
   },
   "image": "🌳🪓🌊"
  },
  {
   "text": "그런데 도끼가 연못에 빠졌어요.",
   "roman": "geureonde dokkiga yeonmose ppajyeosseoyo.",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "But his axe fell into the pond."
   },
   "image": "🪓💦"
  },
  {
   "text": "나무꾼은 울었어요. \"내 도끼! 어떡해요?\"",
   "roman": "namukkuneun ureosseoyo. \"nae dokki! eotteokaeyo?\"",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "The woodcutter cried. \"My axe! What do I do?\""
   },
   "image": "😢"
  },
  {
   "text": "그때 산신령이 나타났어요.",
   "roman": "geuttae sansillyeongi natanasseoyo.",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "Just then, the mountain spirit appeared."
   },
   "image": "✨🧙✨"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"이 금도끼가 네 도끼냐?\"",
   "roman": "\"i geumdokkiga ne dokkinya?\"",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "\"Is this golden axe yours?\""
   },
   "image": "🥇🪓"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"아니요, 제 도끼가 아니에요.\"",
   "roman": "\"aniyo, je dokkiga anieyo.\"",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "\"No, it is not my axe.\""
   },
   "image": "🙅"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"그럼 이 은도끼가 네 도끼냐?\"",
   "roman": "\"geureom i eundokkiga ne dokkinya?\"",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "\"Then is this silver axe yours?\""
   },
   "image": "🥈🪓"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"아니요. 제 도끼는 낡은 쇠도끼예요.\"",
   "roman": "\"aniyo. je dokkineun nalgeun soedokkiyeyo.\"",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "\"No. Mine is an old iron axe.\""
   },
   "image": "🪓"
  },
  {
   "text": "산신령은 웃었어요. \"너는 정직하구나. 세 도끼를 모두 가져라.\"",
   "roman": "sansillyeongeun useosseoyo. \"neoneun jeongjikaguna. se dokkireul modu gajyeora.\"",
   "meaning": {
    "en": "The spirit smiled. \"You are honest. Take all three axes.\""
   },
   "image": "😊🥇🥈🪓"
  }
 ],
